      "description": "Your account's scope, or null when it has none: `{\"products\": {<product>: {<axis>: [values] | null}}}`. A product not listed is not readable; within one, a null axis means every value. The axes are each product's filters: `sports`, `markets`, `bookmakers`, `exchanges` on the six matched boards; `sports`, `markets`, `bookmakers` (venues of both kinds) on `raw`, which also answers `/v2/odds/event/{id}`. Products and axes are always listed in that order and each list sorted. A value a call names outside it is a 403 `*_not_in_plan` with `valid`; a filter left out is trimmed to it."
